 836:     #  MUST NOT BE PRUNED. ***  The older generator inserts `SGIRE_W_UNMAP_WR = 1 << 6',
 837:     #  and #498/cb28a6f added `SGIRE_W_DE_LEN = 1 << 6' to that same enum.  A duplicate
