1156:                                     "exist, which is why its witness field had to read `none`."),
1157:     #  #496's DETECTOR, gated in gate_sh_rounding.sh.  It is the WITNESS's opposite number
1158:     #  and the pair is worth reading together: the witness reads SURVIVAL and the detector is
1159:     #  FORBIDDEN from reading it, because post-fix every one of these accesses exits 0.  Two
1160:     #  files, opposite oracles, same defect -- which is why one is gated and one must not be.
1161:     "gdrom_cond_probe.py":
1162:         (CLASS_DETECTOR, "#496 GDROM_UNKNOWN_0x88 + GDROM_COND bad-value declines and the "
1163:                          "d->cond store relocation -- 16 rows, keystone `R5 cond keep`"),
1164: 
1165:     #  gdromcondlies RUNG-3 WITNESS, 2026-08-30.  CLASS_WITNESS on the toclen precedent
1166:     #  three entries up, and for the identical reason: its two kill rows INVERT the day
1167:     #  the fix lands, so gating it would manufacture a regression.  The round's standing
1168:     #  coverage is its own detector, which is a separate deliverable.
1169:     "artifacts/gdromcondlies/witness_20260830/gdrom_cond_witness.py": (CLASS_WITNESS,
1170:                                     "gdromcondlies rung-3 on the unmodified -E dreamcast: "
1171:                                     "one guest mov.w per site ends the host at both live "
1172:                                     "BADVAL exits (GDROM_UNKNOWN_0x88 != 0xb, GDROM_COND "
1173:                                     "unmodelled), 15/15 on the committed build before any "
1174:                                     "edit.  Carries BOTH mandatory controls plus two the "
1175:                                     "ladder does not require and this result needs: a "
1176:                                     "DEVICE-SIGNATURE row in the strong form (a "
1177:                                     "TRANSFORMATION only the device performs -- the write "
1178:                                     "arm masks to a byte, so 0x1234 to CNTLO reads back "
1179:                                     "0x34, which RAM would not do), and ACCEPT rows.  The "
1180:                                     "accept rows are what pin the defect to the VALUE and "
1181:                                     "therefore to #443 BADVAL, rather than to the offset "
1182:                                     "being unserviceable, which is the already-fixed #461 "
1183:                                     "default-arm defect.  *** ITS ACCEPT ROWS MUST NOT BE "
1184:                                     "CARRIED INTO THE DETECTOR UNCHANGED: they discriminate "
1185:                                     "on SURVIVAL, and the fix makes survival universally "
1186:                                     "green -- a survival oracle at a refusal-effect site is "
1187:                                     "the CHANNEL check's canonical vacuous row.  Named by "
1188:                                     "the fable5 seat on pass 1, before the detector existed."),
1189:     #  #497 PASS 1, the opus5 seat, 2026-08-30.  CLASS_RESEARCH: these are EVIDENCE preserved
1190:     #  so two measured escapes can be re-run rather than believed, not tests owed a gate.
1191:     #
1192:     #  They matter more than a usual artifacts drop because the seat DISCHARGED THE WITNESS
