1416:                                    "two-leg differential AND needs a ciR: CD-ROM rig "
1417:                                    "the battery does not build today"),
1418:     "wdc_altoffset_4bit_probe.py": ("2026-09-20",
1419:                                     "two-leg differential; shares the single-leg-mode "
1420:                                     "debt with its two siblings"),
