 943: #  chosen over the obvious whole-function revert for a measured reason: it leaves the
 944: #  fsync count at 2, so any test counting fsync alone stays GREEN, and only the fflush
 945: #  row goes red (1, want 2).  It is also the edit a maintainer might make in good faith,
