 499: #  and the first caused by staging rather than by forgetting.
 500: #
 501: #  The structural note above says a probe shipping in the same commit as its gate wiring cannot
 502: #  skip the pin, because the wiring forces a gate run.  `git add -A` defeats that by adding files
