 561: #  MEASURED that exact configuration (full prompt, whole buffer) failing just as
 562: #  completely as the bare one: arm B scored 0/80, byte-identical to arm A.
 563: #
 564: #  So count it explicitly.  The two that exist are arm_flags_probe.py:144 and
 565: #  :645 -- known, filed, and deliberately out of #392's scope.  Pinning the count
