 317:                     % passtok.group(1))
 318:             else:
 319:                 #  *** (7) DID THE MUTANT REACH THE COMPILER AT ALL?  COMPARE WHAT THE
 320:                 #  COMPILER PRODUCED, NOT WHAT THIS HELPER WROTE. ***  Every check above is
 321:                 #  about the TREE; none of them proves the compiler consumed it.  Three
 322:                 #  escapes were CONSTRUCTED AND MEASURED that pass a tree-file postcondition
 323:                 #  and still print the false "the detector did NOT report a failure":
 324:                 #
 325:                 #    * `new` = `old` plus a trailing comment -- lands, compiles, inert;
 326:                 #    * SELFMUTANT_EXTRA_FLAGS naming the subject by an ABSOLUTE path, so the
 327:                 #      REPO copy is compiled while the tree copy sits there mutated.  That is
