 336:                 #  than heuristic.  Measured across all 12 shipped lanes: mutant differs from
 337:                 #  pristine 12/12, and the same source at the same path builds byte-identical
 338:                 #  to itself.  Cost 0.048 ms of sha256 against a 1370 ms build.
 339:                 #
