```

The call deliberately starts at column zero: the manifest’s backing-call regex requires that. Flattening object-list newlines matters because the helper interpolates the flags into shell command text. The relative device include path selects the **mirrored subject**. `--no-gc-sections` overrides the helper’s default to match the ordinary gate’s link policy; the helper already appends `-lm`.

Replace the two manifest assignments at their respective locations with:

